⍝ Component file viewer and diff: the APL side. Reads files, never changes them.
⍝ Normally run through dcf.py, which makes any path on your machine visible
⍝ to the container. Inside the container:
⍝
⍝   dyalogscript dcf.apls view FILE              list the components
⍝   dyalogscript dcf.apls view FILE N            show component N in full
⍝   dyalogscript dcf.apls diff OLD NEW           what changed (two files or two folders)
⍝   dyalogscript dcf.apls dump FILE OUT.json     everything about FILE, as JSON
⍝   dyalogscript dcf.apls diffjson OLD NEW OUT.json
⍝
⍝ Exit code: 0 ok (diff: no differences), 1 diff found differences, 2 error.
args←2⎕NQ'.' 'GetCommandLineArgs'
here←⊃1⎕NPARTS⊃args
args←1↓args
code←0
:Trap 0
    {}⎕FIX'file://',here,'DCF.apln'
    cmd←{0=≢⍵:'' ⋄ ⊃⍵}args
    Path←{'.dcf'≡¯4↑⍵:¯4↓⍵ ⋄ ⍵}               ⍝ ⎕F… functions add .dcf themselves
    IsDir←{1=1 ⎕NINFO ⍵}
    :Select cmd
    :Case 'view'
        :If 2=≢args
            ⎕←↑DCF.List DCF.Dump Path 2⊃args
        :Else
            t←DCF.Tie Path 2⊃args
            n←⍎3⊃args
            v←⎕FREAD t n
            m←t DCF.Meta n
            ⎕←'component ',(⍕n),': ',(DCF.Kind v),', shape ',(⍕⍴v),', ',(⍕m.bytes),' bytes, written ',m.written
            ⎕←''
            :If 9=⌊⎕NC'v'
                :For f :In DCF.Names v
                    ⎕←f,':' ⋄ ⎕←v⍎f ⋄ ⎕←''
                :EndFor
                :If 0<≢fns←v.⎕NL ¯3 ¯4 ⋄ ⎕←'functions: ',⍕fns ⋄ :EndIf
            :Else
                ⎕←v
            :EndIf
            ⎕FUNTIE t
        :EndIf
    :Case 'diff'
        (old new)←1↓3↑args
        :If IsDir old
            r←DCF.DiffFolders old new
            same←∧/r.files.status≡¨⊂'same'
        :Else
            r←DCF.DiffFiles(Path old)(Path new)
            same←0=+/r.(changed added removed)
        :EndIf
        ⎕←↑DCF.Report r
        code←~same
    :Case 'dump'
        (⊂DCF.JSON DCF.Dump Path 2⊃args)⎕NPUT(3⊃args)1
    :Case 'diffjson'
        (old new out)←1↓4↑args
        :If IsDir old
            r←DCF.DiffFolders old new
        :Else
            r←DCF.DiffFiles(Path old)(Path new)
        :EndIf
        (⊂DCF.JSON r)⎕NPUT out 1
    :Else
        ⎕←'usage: dcf.apls view FILE [N] | diff OLD NEW | dump FILE OUT | diffjson OLD NEW OUT'
        code←2
    :EndSelect
:Else
    ⎕←'dcf: ',⎕DMX.EM,(×≢⎕DMX.Message)/': ',⎕DMX.Message
    :If ~∨/'__session_input__'⍷2⊃⎕DMX.DM ⋄ ⎕←'     at ',2⊃⎕DMX.DM ⋄ :EndIf   ⍝ the failing line, if in DCF
    code←2
:EndTrap
⍝ ⎕OFF stays on its own line: `⎕OFF expression` exits before the expression runs
⎕OFF code
